SUMMARY:2026 ASEAN Summits (Philippines)
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 ASEAN Summits are two series of diplomatic conferences
  centering on the Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN)\, which a
 re held in the Philippines in 2026. It comprised the 48th ASEAN Summit hel
 d on 6–8 May in Cebu and the 49th ASEAN Summit scheduled for 16–18 Nov
 ember in Metro Manila.\n\nSummit: Philippines\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/2026_ASEAN_Summits\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruv
 ian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
