SUMMARY:The United States Senate votes 86–12 to advance legislation impos
 ing sanctions on Russia's energy revenues
DESCRIPTION:The United States Senate votes 86–12 to advance legislation i
 mposing sanctions on Russia's energy revenues\, financial institutions\, o
 fficials\, and shadow fleet\, while authorizing tariffs of up to 100% on m
 ajor buyers of Russian oil and gas.\n\nSanctions: Russia\nReported by Poli
 tico: https://www.politico.com/news/2026/07/28/senators-advance-russia-san
