SUMMARY:2026 Alberta independence referendum (Canada)
DESCRIPTION:The independence question of the 2026 Alberta referendum is one
  of 10 questions of the 2026 Alberta referendum election\, which took plac
 e on October 19\, 2026. The question was a choice of two options: whether 
 to remain in Canada or for the province of Alberta to take steps toward ho
 lding a binding referendum on separating from Canada.\n\nReferendum: Canad
 a\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Alberta_independence_referen
