SUMMARY:2026 Navajo Nation presidential election (United States)
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Navajo Nation presidential election will take place on
  Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026\, to elect the president and vice president o
 f the Navajo Nation. The primary election was held on June 2 in New Mexico
 \, June 23 in Utah\, and July 21 in Arizona to align with each state's pri
 mary elections.\n\nElection: United States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.o
